uvicorn py_file_name:app --reload

--pipeline from transformers is a API which abstracts the internal working of the model and does around 29 tasks like text-classification, audio-classification, text-generation and returns
a pipeline like in the code. we just ned to pass model, tokenizer and task to do to it.

-- using post method to retrieve the query as well as we are using json to send the data from streamlit to backend. In other cases we can use get method.
-- to make the llm to load quick we use @st.cache_resource to load llm and tokenizer it.
-- to maintain the context data retrieved from the db we use st.session_state to store the context data which will store the context even when reruns and during UI interaction.
